    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>THE SUN IS RISING.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>THERE'S NOT A CLOUD IN THE SKY.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>TRULY - A WONDERFUL DAY TO BE A HORSE.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERVIEW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >T\u00d6LT is a first-person adventure game set on a fully explorable island.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective is simple. You are a horse who lives on an island with all your friends. You wish for nothing more than to simply run around and hang out. Just as all horses love to do.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812490/extras/2a2b699ac28a86cf2724ff03c313ddfe.poster.avif?t=1750691069\" width=706 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812490/extras/2a2b699ac28a86cf2724ff03c313ddfe.webm?t=1750691069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812490/extras/2a2b699ac28a86cf2724ff03c313ddfe.mp4?t=1750691069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The humans on this island seem worried about something. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if what they say is true, it is of no concern to horses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You have <i>everything you need</i> right in front of you. Rich pastures. Beautiful rivers. Picturesque mountains. A mysterious forest. <span class=\"bb_strike\">A bustling town filled with humans.</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're already living each day like it's your last, so there is nothing more for you to fear.<br>A happy ending lies ahead. All you must do is simply be yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>THE SUN IS RISING.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>THERE'S NOT A CLOUD IN THE SKY.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>TRULY - A WONDERFUL DAY TO BE A HORSE.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERVIEW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >T\u00d6LT is a first-person adventure game set on a fully explorable island.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective is simple. You are a horse who lives on an island with all your friends. You wish for nothing more than to simply run around and hang out. Just as all horses love to do.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812490/extras/2a2b699ac28a86cf2724ff03c313ddfe.poster.avif?t=1750691069\" width=706 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812490/extras/2a2b699ac28a86cf2724ff03c313ddfe.webm?t=1750691069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812490/extras/2a2b699ac28a86cf2724ff03c313ddfe.mp4?t=1750691069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The humans on this island seem worried about something. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if what they say is true, it is of no concern to horses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You have <i>everything you need</i> right in front of you. Rich pastures. Beautiful rivers. Picturesque mountains. A mysterious forest. <span class=\"bb_strike\">A bustling town filled with humans.</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're already living each day like it's your last, so there is nothing more for you to fear.<br>A happy ending lies ahead. All you must do is simply be yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>",
